        {
          "text": "Kandi mbona umumarayika wundi aguruka yātiriye ijuru, afise ubutumwa bgiza butazoshira bgo kubarira ababa kw isi n’amahanga yose n’imiryango yose n’indimi zose n’amoko yose. ",
