        {
          "text": "Avuga n’ijwi rirenga, ati Mwubahe Imana, muyihimbaze, kukw igihe c’amateka yayo gishitse, musenge iyaremye ijuru n’isi n’ikiyaga n’amasōko y’amazi.",
