          "text": "Numva ijwi rivuye mw ijuru rimbgira, rit’ Andika, ut’ Uhereye none hahirwa abapfa bapfira mu Mwami. Kandi Mpwemu aravuga, at’ Ego me, ngo baruhuke ubutame bgabo, kukw ibikorwa vyabo bijana na bo bibakurikiye.",
